Notes: A 13-wide diamond with a shaded cross in the centre printed "No 6" (shown as _); two words, 33-34 and 35-36, run down the centre column above and below the cross. The number is printed in the centre block and in the intro ("Here is No. 6 in FUN'S series of cross-word puzzles."). No credit is printed. Read by hand from the Milwaukee Sentinel's page (Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_01_25_67_fun.png), solution from Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_02_01_67_key.png, by Claude, 2026-11-16.


